        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown for a Typical Home (2,000 sq. ft.)"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Asphalt Shingles: $9,000 to $22,000 total (roughly $4.50 to $6.50 per square foot installed). General entry-level or average Utah roof replacements often land between $8,700 and $12,000 for standard sizing/configurations .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              4,
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Metal Roof: $19,000 to $36,000+ total (roughly $8.00 to $18.00+ per square foot installed, depending on whether you choose aluminum, steel, or stone-coated steel). Aluminum options in areas like Salt Lake City often run around $680 to $800 per square ($68k\u2013$80k for commercial scale, or ~$13k\u2013$16k scaled depending on square footage nuances) .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              4,
              5,
              6,
              7
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Comparison Factors in Utah"
